10:45 AM. Stream time.

I set up. Wig on   the practiced application getting faster, four minutes now instead of ten. VoxMorph calibrated. OBS open. Webcam tilted up, framing from the nose upward. Desk lamp angled from the left. I check the preview   eyes, lashes, brows, hair. The feminized zone. The zone that earned $210.

But today is different. Today I have techniques.

I adjust my chair so I'm sitting slightly forward   the lean-in as default posture. I position my hands where they can reach the wig hair naturally. I locate the webcam lens   the exact point I need to look at to create eye contact   and I mark it mentally. Not the chat window. Not the game. The lens. The viewer's eyes.

ElliePlayz   Live
Category: Just Chatting → Gunmetal Requiem
Viewers: 0

I click "Go Live." Look at the lens. Right at it. Right at them.

[[Go Live|day_4_4_kira]]

