The eye contact is working. The direct-to-lens technique from the video   the viewers feel seen. They feel like Ellie is looking at them personally. The comments reflect it immediately: "she looked directly at me." Because I did. I looked at the lens. At the camera. At the portal between my apartment and their screen. And they felt it.

